      <data key="d0">石頭記</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">《石頭記》 is a significant literary work that provides a commentary on societal morals, class struggles, and interpersonal relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;《石頭記》是《紅樓夢》的另一個名稱，反映了書籍中石頭的特別意義和文化內涵。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f609ba81173fcf1bab6c6acd868500d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-120e776f266b98c7ffc41021109650ad</data>
