      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">空空道人 is a character who reflects on societal issues and writes a narrative connecting personal emotions with a larger commentary on life.&lt;SEP&gt;空空道人 is a seeker of truth and immortality who interacts with a stone, discovering its story.</data>
