      <data key="d2">和尚 is a monk mentioned in the text, communicating important messages and reflecting the community's sentiments.&lt;SEP&gt;和尚 is a monk who uses magical powers to transform a stone and guide 石頭 on his journey.&lt;SEP&gt;和尚 is another monk appearing in the story, sharing similar eccentricity with道士, and contributing to the philosophical discourse within the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;和尚 is another monk in the story, depicted with disheveled appearances and similar behavior to道士, contributing to the dialogue around fate and destiny.</data>
