      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">英蓮 is the daughter of 士隱 who goes missing, prompting distress among her parents.&lt;SEP&gt;英蓮 is the daughter of 甄士隱, described as a young girl with potential to influence the family legacy.&lt;SEP&gt;英蓮 is the daughter of士隱, depicted with beauty and innocence; she is the object of her father's affection and care.&lt;SEP&gt;英蓮 is士隱's daughter, described affectionately, and a focal point for士隱's paternal attention in the narrative.</data>
