      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">士隱 is a character who interacts with others in the narrative, exhibiting paternal feelings toward his daughter, 英蓮, and shows reluctance towards a mad monk's comments.&lt;SEP&gt;士隱 is a character who interacts with various individuals in the narrative, expressing familial affection towards his daughter, 英蓮, and engaging in dialogues with other characters.&lt;SEP&gt;士隱 is a character who is depicted as a father concerned about his daughter's well-being and experiences distress due to her disappearance.&lt;SEP&gt;士隱 is a character who reflects on the words of a道人, showing understanding and wisdom.&lt;SEP&gt;士隱 is a scholar who invites another character, 雨村, to join him for a festive meal during the Mid-Autumn Festival.</data>
